{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:30:01Z","created_by_operation":"op_e3b92c8c029e44a09a36df10bea06c69","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_1c622fc1c8c16a6b3ba6f70d5cf850bad1d174ae8a73dd49da86f6c41a210aee","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"patriceckhart/zot@f60e492e5518 snapshot 17a5430f57315354","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_67627541b2dec0f69e1d408e8bdf96c21398268d7496a88a1abd98cf6aa9299d","slc_72508ccb6dc96769a5831164fb31a90157923eba6094632c6299757d6cf936e3"],"source_ids":["src_a0a81e8bfa695153bbd3b68547ec1533"],"text":"A Go SDK is offered via the packages/agent/sdk import, where a Runtime per project exposes Prompt(ctx, text, images) returning a channel of events; both embedding paths share one event schema.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:30:01Z","updated_by_operation":"op_e3b92c8c029e44a09a36df10bea06c69"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:30:01Z","created_by_operation":"op_e3b92c8c029e44a09a36df10bea06c69","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_1c6d041065aed4ab3163efa38033512a8335ed9a76949b0a8d7aa2da0ce4197c","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"patriceckhart/zot@f60e492e5518 snapshot 17a5430f57315354","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_bb27fd72ec471b06a26d4d15b4e2df6a48bec1c723b8fdcc083d8be684a49e7d"],"source_ids":["src_a0a81e8bfa695153bbd3b68547ec1533"],"text":"Extensions run in any language via subprocess plus JSON-RPC, none installed by default, opted into with `zot ext install` or `zot --ext`; themes are user and extension JSON files.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:30:01Z","updated_by_operation":"op_e3b92c8c029e44a09a36df10bea06c69"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:30:01Z","created_by_operation":"op_e3b92c8c029e44a09a36df10bea06c69","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_230e19c5a41cde4c7efd4c9c760ae32fe221591076cc572b1fb5fce3e07f2a6f","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"patriceckhart/zot@f60e492e5518 snapshot 17a5430f57315354","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_52ed93fdc2cdf343409d4140015be6e1f9ace449cb194de5ee93410884a62922","slc_bb27fd72ec471b06a26d4d15b4e2df6a48bec1c723b8fdcc083d8be684a49e7d","slc_d55d788229d42e406383a61a6e593adbc2dd50d102cb66793c1bd02965474955"],"source_ids":["src_a0a81e8bfa695153bbd3b68547ec1533"],"text":"zotfile agents package instructions, skills, requirements, and enforced tool permissions; they can run from local directories, .zot archives, or temporary public GitHub downloads, with no built-in registry or allowlist.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:30:01Z","updated_by_operation":"op_e3b92c8c029e44a09a36df10bea06c69"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:30:01Z","created_by_operation":"op_e3b92c8c029e44a09a36df10bea06c69","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_38bd97424f2d210a3fbcecf31f4f28435fffff36f7a1e20c5764296a17806164","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"patriceckhart/zot@f60e492e5518 snapshot 17a5430f57315354","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_103217c90a672490b7d7e7f8045b6f4a1633efd0fbc37bce4c127a985a84ba38","slc_b6f9f7ee3412765144cf887e7001da7f18c26c2a98b7be8309fac512720a65b2","slc_bb27fd72ec471b06a26d4d15b4e2df6a48bec1c723b8fdcc083d8be684a49e7d","slc_e533c9781ba851d9ad3e320be6191379c558bdf36543a3dbf6b1dc9046cff2f9"],"source_ids":["src_a0a81e8bfa695153bbd3b68547ec1533"],"text":"Built-in tools include read (with image inlining), write, edit, bash, and glob; a PowerShell tool exists on Windows, off by default and toggleable in /settings or via --tools.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:30:01Z","updated_by_operation":"op_e3b92c8c029e44a09a36df10bea06c69"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:30:01Z","created_by_operation":"op_e3b92c8c029e44a09a36df10bea06c69","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_395c04de3d710c3c3f26bd5abf6ca7b0f680bc6b7de2fcf500829e5e9cfb3f42","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"patriceckhart/zot@f60e492e5518 snapshot 17a5430f57315354","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_67627541b2dec0f69e1d408e8bdf96c21398268d7496a88a1abd98cf6aa9299d","slc_abeb35bb921cab59bd88bd9dcdc839bfe09eaf55c3f222739d7eeb26bbd2f15d","slc_e2b886885e81fb59c9441d6ed2a9e3ce2d7d4c5c9bc3af676d0eee9279b643fb"],"source_ids":["src_a0a81e8bfa695153bbd3b68547ec1533"],"text":"The CLI supports interactive TUI, print, stream, piped-input, and JSON modes, plus an `zot rpc` long-lived subprocess speaking newline-delimited JSON for embedding in other applications.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:30:01Z","updated_by_operation":"op_e3b92c8c029e44a09a36df10bea06c69"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:30:01Z","created_by_operation":"op_e3b92c8c029e44a09a36df10bea06c69","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_68ab3e9a8301c1533457d28b25e0d37e9908ecc395cb8836eac1cac1223933e3","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=skills-patterns","setting":"patriceckhart/zot@f60e492e5518 snapshot 17a5430f57315354","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_344e3623c0a7ab510190af8feaf286859a56498db40209e3ad6d2999bba7cd58","slc_3c6d450907c5816322366b93f2e4dcde5f7a31897c25a5d01404696fccc0391a","slc_914a221bba9c6f17bef53ab30ace6567c286fff9b4e839e71d296b3718b67d77","slc_96b91eb36b8f990533a704e3ab5f4e56efae010fa6097cde876f73038bc6d15e","slc_bb27fd72ec471b06a26d4d15b4e2df6a48bec1c723b8fdcc083d8be684a49e7d"],"source_ids":["src_a0a81e8bfa695153bbd3b68547ec1533"],"text":"Standing instructions come from AGENTS.md files (global plus root-to-cwd chain, deeper files overriding), while reusable instructions use SKILL.md files; SYSTEM.md replaces the built-in identity and --system-prompt wins per invocation.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:30:01Z","updated_by_operation":"op_e3b92c8c029e44a09a36df10bea06c69"}
