{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:30:01Z","created_by_operation":"op_e3b92c8c029e44a09a36df10bea06c69","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_c005faee2e77868104178371290efc16184f5ad643f01b26cc346a0d90d8bac0","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"patriceckhart/zot@f60e492e5518 snapshot 17a5430f57315354","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_0b8cabce51e41b764181021afcf13e948bd5fb0cfe2a1e065773400e349fcb51","slc_28711e6cc390beb24c68a3d67a9a2cd06c8f0cf05eb5d1ecdf9de40c2862184f","slc_44a2cd3080491fe025deb65651593fe377527cd09059b7c3a10f31572735635e","slc_8c4d3c8154e080b4d1773e332e1712a6d9de1fe959f92186fa94add06fe0b56e"],"source_ids":["src_a0a81e8bfa695153bbd3b68547ec1533"],"text":"/swarm spawns background subagents as separate zot subprocesses sharing the host's working directory, with a dashboard, per-agent session files and unix-socket inboxes under $ZOT_HOME/swarm/agents/<id>/, and persistence across restarts as detached agents.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:30:01Z","updated_by_operation":"op_e3b92c8c029e44a09a36df10bea06c69"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:30:01Z","created_by_operation":"op_e3b92c8c029e44a09a36df10bea06c69","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_c25e436df16c4a07762110583c4f849376dd9ab88744315e689e3b67351d3b31","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"patriceckhart/zot@f60e492e5518 snapshot 17a5430f57315354","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_8e81d2d270d5562b025921f1722b1a2c7236c641c0324da54785c2282c6e26f8","slc_9a1ae1a41e5a1d791521afa1dc7ef29d34d7f257482e1dfe2bcdc9d6a4ed446a"],"source_ids":["src_a0a81e8bfa695153bbd3b68547ec1533"],"text":"An opt-in auto-swarm setting gives the main agent a swarm_spawn tool and prompt nudge to fork sub-agents for parallel work, injecting an update message when the batch finishes; it is off by default.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:30:01Z","updated_by_operation":"op_e3b92c8c029e44a09a36df10bea06c69"}
